nos-shares (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * SMB/CIFS and NFS share management
  * Time Machine support via Samba VFS
  * Recycle bin functionality
  * POSIX ACL-based access control
  * Avahi/mDNS service discovery
  * Migration support for existing configs

